Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.40,0:22:16.77,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}四处寻觅着
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.77,0:22:20.07,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}まだ知らない　君を探してる
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.77,0:22:20.07,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}那个陌生的你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.61,0:22:23.20,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}話したい　ことばかりで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.61,0:22:23.20,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}怀揣满腔情思
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.20,0:22:25.83,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}時間が過ぎてゆく
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.20,0:22:25.83,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}时光缓缓流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.83,0:22:27.83,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}明日も　ここで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.83,0:22:27.83,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}愿明天在此地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.83,0:22:30.66,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}同じ場所で会えるように
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.83,0:22:30.66,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}再度与你相会
